## Executive Summary

Claude Opus 4.5 is Anthropic's latest frontier model from their Claude series. The Opus designation indicates it's Anthropic's highest-capability model, positioned as their flagship offering for complex, high-stakes tasks. As part of the Claude 4.5 family, this model represents Anthropic's continued advancement in safe, reliable AI systems, maintaining strong performance across reasoning, coding, and general language tasks while emphasizing safety and alignment.

